      "text": "Let $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ be the roots of $x^2 - 6x - 2 = 0$. If $a_n = \\alpha^n - \\beta^n$ for $n \\ge 1$, then the value of $\\frac{a_{10} - 2a_8}{2a_9}$ is equal to:",
