      "explanation": "Since $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ satisfy $x^2 - 6x - 2 = 0$, by Newton's Theorem for $a_n = \\alpha^n - \\beta^n$:\n$$a_n - 6a_{n-1} - 2a_{n-2} = 0$$\n\nFor $n = 10$:\n$$a_{10} - 6a_9 - 2a_8 = 0$$\n$$a_{10} - 2a_8 = 6a_9$$\n\nNow divide both sides by $2a_9$:\n$$\\frac{a_{10} - 2a_8}{2a_9} = \\frac{6a_9}{2a_9} = 3$$",
